       5969     4        v        LCOH2= ndH2(i,j,k)*ndCO(i,j,k) * 3.60834d4*Tn(i,j,k)*dexp(-(3.14d2/Tn(i,j,k))**0.333d0)*dexp(-3.08d0/Tn(i,j,k))
       5970     4                 !***------------------------- Photo-electric Heating
