                              <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                              <<<  [OPTIMIZATION]
                              <<<    PREFETCH(HARD) Expected by compiler :
                              <<<      ndH, ndp, ndH2, ndHe, ndHep, U, nde
                              <<<      ndCp, Nfgr, NH2, ndfgr, ndtot, ndO, NnC
                              <<<    PREFETCH(SOFT) : 14
                              <<<     SEQUENTIAL : 14
                              <<<      NnC: 2, NCO: 4, ndCO: 2, ndC: 2, U: 2
                              <<<      ndHm: 2
                              <<<    SPILLS :
